  "summary": "Test rearview camera function under reverse conditions because the image goes blank and inoperable, and an open recall covers this symptom.",
  "rationale": "The narrative reports that while attempting to reverse, the rearview camera became inoperable and the image appeared blank. This matches recall 25V695000 for blank, intermittent, or distorted rearview camera images when in reverse, but the rulebook returned no targeted test entry, so the standard field-quality test is proposed. The recall parts were not yet available and the vehicle was not diagnosed or repaired.",
